@BoxOffice_HostAddress = https://localhost:7178

### Events on sale, with live availability
GET {{BoxOffice_HostAddress}}/api/events
Accept: application/json

### One event, with availability per section
GET {{BoxOffice_HostAddress}}/api/events/midnight-arcade-seattle
Accept: application/json

### Reserve seats (201 Created)
POST {{BoxOffice_HostAddress}}/api/events/midnight-arcade-seattle/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fanId": "fan-7f3a91",
  "sectionId": "floor",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Look up a reservation (use the id from the previous response)
GET {{BoxOffice_HostAddress}}/api/events/midnight-arcade-seattle/reservations/GT-4C1E8B
Accept: application/json

### Cancel a reservation and release its seats
DELETE {{BoxOffice_HostAddress}}/api/events/midnight-arcade-seattle/reservations/GT-4C1E8B

### 400 validation problem details (unknown section, too many seats)
POST {{BoxOffice_HostAddress}}/api/events/midnight-arcade-seattle/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fanId": "fan-7f3a91",
  "sectionId": "backstage",
  "quantity": 12
}

### 409 problem details once the fan holds 8 seats for the event
POST {{BoxOffice_HostAddress}}/api/events/midnight-arcade-seattle/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fanId": "fan-7f3a91",
  "sectionId": "upper-bowl",
  "quantity": 8
}

### 404 problem details
GET {{BoxOffice_HostAddress}}/api/events/summer-fest-2027
Accept: application/problem+json

### OpenAPI document
GET {{BoxOffice_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
